# GLib from upstream's release, built by its own Meson with one patch
# (glib-dolly.patch: g_unix_fd_query_path is not supported here, as on Hurd).
# A program that links GLib is threaded, calls through libffi (dso@0's FFI)
# and calls functions through pointers cast to types of other parameters,
# which traps in WebAssembly: GObject's pkg-config file asks cc for
# --dolly-cast-emulation (Binaryen's wasm-opt --fpcast-emu after the link),
# and this package's own programs are passed through it here.
FROM /v0.1.3/demos/tools/Dollyfile-tools-build abd2c362440a6b2f66378514838d3c5b47dd729196304016fe49ce7d626db475
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/tools/Dollyfile-meson 04e74725d896b7895370723a279c5be093d39edfaa0fd2d6fccaa5e378fa027f
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/zero-ad/Dollyfile-pkgconf a3f26688786591215b6ac7a4de7ae841762429cb3a34573c370016ca9fbc8bef
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/tools/Dollyfile-xz 066acb47b23b61cad516405037687b1b24b4baf6c0b18ecbd2679bbb2694340f
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/tools/Dollyfile-tar 73c96760ce2139d96b960f3dc8401cf00555c88cef3a2387a210c9f762059cf5
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/tools/Dollyfile-binaryen a1056b4fa0ed1fde9e70f9eaa06f42caa5d1d49bafc252d5ff8e7508ded32964
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/python/Dollyfile-libffi 8c4e1780e8aa6db514cb1d9fff4fab5bd19088a185180dcc371e60cc76273f67
